WEBVTT

00:00:04.683 --> 00:00:06.101
I am Aiko Tachibana.

00:00:07.061 --> 00:00:10.189
I've finally met the other me.

00:00:11.857 --> 00:00:13.525
Wait!

00:00:15.069 --> 00:00:16.654
I'm sorry I scared you.

00:00:17.738 --> 00:00:20.241
I just wanted to talk.

00:00:20.407 --> 00:00:23.160
What? With me?

00:00:25.704 --> 00:00:26.789
I've been waiting.

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:30.793
Ever since I first found out about you.

00:00:32.253 --> 00:00:34.046
That's my junior high uniform.

00:00:34.797 --> 00:00:36.715
That's me from before the Burst.

00:02:11.644 --> 00:02:13.646
Can this place get attacked, too?

00:02:13.771 --> 00:02:15.105
Is there a shelter?

00:02:15.189 --> 00:02:17.566
-Yes!
-Then let's get there now!

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:19.360
-We have to stop it!
-What?

00:02:19.777 --> 00:02:22.488
An external attack
won't wipe out the Matter.

00:02:22.988 --> 00:02:26.283
It will destroy
the only thing holding the matter back--

00:02:26.408 --> 00:02:27.910
Aiko Tachibana's brain.

00:02:28.494 --> 00:02:31.038
You mean it will make it more active?

00:02:31.538 --> 00:02:32.623
That's right.

00:02:35.793 --> 00:02:39.963
But if we return the artificial brain
to the Matter,

00:02:40.047 --> 00:02:41.465
it will end all of this.

00:02:41.799 --> 00:02:44.885
If that's the case, I'll do as you say.

00:02:45.219 --> 00:02:46.261
Sagami!

00:02:46.345 --> 00:02:49.390
That's the mission
Shino left for us to complete.

00:02:52.851 --> 00:02:56.522
You're the key to this whole thing.
What's that look for?

00:02:57.523 --> 00:03:01.318
You decided yourself
that you must do this, right?

00:03:02.486 --> 00:03:03.320
That's right.

00:03:03.737 --> 00:03:07.991
I'll end the Burst, and return
Aiko Tachibana to her real body.

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:09.785
That's my goal.

00:03:11.286 --> 00:03:12.121
That's why...

00:03:13.038 --> 00:03:15.874
That was the only reason
I brought her here.

00:03:16.583 --> 00:03:19.294
Are you crazy? You can't be serious!

00:03:19.962 --> 00:03:23.882
After all the time you've spent with her,
don't you feel anything?

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:27.594
Why are you so concerned about Tachibana?

00:03:28.554 --> 00:03:30.639
Don't make me say it! You know why!

00:03:31.598 --> 00:03:32.933
I'm in love.

00:03:36.353 --> 00:03:37.187
Kazuki.

00:03:37.855 --> 00:03:38.981
So what if I am?

00:03:39.398 --> 00:03:43.026
I thought we were friends!
Haven't you felt anything for her?

00:03:44.653 --> 00:03:48.323
But you say Aiko is artificial!

00:03:48.741 --> 00:03:50.784
So why am I having these feelings?

00:03:52.244 --> 00:03:54.913
They're feelings
based on a misunderstanding.

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:57.541
Change your thinking and they'll go away.

00:03:58.959 --> 00:04:01.587
You may be some famous researcher,

00:04:02.087 --> 00:04:03.839
but even I understand this.

00:04:04.423 --> 00:04:06.550
Someone like you...

00:04:07.634 --> 00:04:09.636
can never save anyone!

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:10.804
Kazuki!

00:04:11.555 --> 00:04:12.848
It's coming!

00:04:15.642 --> 00:04:17.394
No need to hide it anymore.

00:04:18.604 --> 00:04:21.190
I'll find Tachibana. You keep descending!

00:04:21.273 --> 00:04:22.191
Hey! Kanzaki!

00:04:22.441 --> 00:04:23.275
Kanzaki!

00:04:25.194 --> 00:04:27.571
You want to talk to me?

00:04:28.238 --> 00:04:29.072
Yes.

00:04:29.948 --> 00:04:30.783
But...

00:04:33.035 --> 00:04:35.412
What am I?

00:04:36.163 --> 00:04:36.997
You are...

00:04:39.249 --> 00:04:40.959
Kanzaki told me...

00:04:42.044 --> 00:04:44.880
that the other me was artificial.

00:04:45.964 --> 00:04:47.382
That she'd be destroyed.

00:04:48.217 --> 00:04:50.469
Her thoughts are no longer necessary.

00:04:53.222 --> 00:04:55.808
But he meant me.

00:04:58.310 --> 00:04:59.436
That's not true.

00:05:00.145 --> 00:05:02.689
My whole existence, here and now,

00:05:03.315 --> 00:05:04.608
is thanks to you.

00:05:06.235 --> 00:05:07.069
You lie.

00:05:08.779 --> 00:05:10.697
You think the same, don't you?

00:05:11.198 --> 00:05:13.033
You want to get rid of me, too!

00:05:13.951 --> 00:05:14.785
That's not...

00:05:14.868 --> 00:05:16.411
I don't believe you!

00:05:17.663 --> 00:05:21.458
I can't believe anything anymore!

00:05:22.793 --> 00:05:23.752
Nothing...

00:05:29.174 --> 00:05:30.008
Listen.

00:05:30.509 --> 00:05:33.178
I want you to know what happened that day,

00:05:34.304 --> 00:05:36.390
and everything that happened since,

00:05:39.309 --> 00:05:40.269
and all of me.

00:05:42.646 --> 00:05:44.815
You guys take the stairs down.

00:05:45.524 --> 00:05:46.525
I'll go this way.

00:05:47.484 --> 00:05:48.944
Wait! That's suicide!

00:05:49.236 --> 00:05:51.822
If we go the same way,
the activity will focus there.

00:05:51.905 --> 00:05:53.031
Yeah, but...

00:05:57.244 --> 00:05:58.120
Let's hurry.

00:05:58.954 --> 00:06:00.122
-Kaede!
-Yes?

00:06:00.706 --> 00:06:02.040
We'll be fine.

00:06:02.207 --> 00:06:03.250
What?

00:06:04.209 --> 00:06:05.460
Why is he the one?

00:06:06.044 --> 00:06:07.379
He can't save Aiko!

00:06:16.597 --> 00:06:18.390
The activity is spreading.

00:06:21.727 --> 00:06:23.437
This is Yura's laboratory.

00:06:24.396 --> 00:06:27.774
What? This is Dr. Yura's lab?

00:06:33.113 --> 00:06:36.950
So, you knew that Kanzaki is Dr. Yura?

00:06:37.951 --> 00:06:38.785
Yes.

00:06:39.202 --> 00:06:44.625
Did he tell you
that Tachibana's brain was artificial?

00:06:48.629 --> 00:06:52.674
He's deceived all of us
from the very start.

00:06:53.842 --> 00:06:54.718
You're right.

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:58.764
If we completed the mission
without knowing the truth,

00:06:59.389 --> 00:07:03.810
none of us would have felt
any remorse or guilt toward Aiko.

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:07.731
Even Aiko herself

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:11.610
would have left this world
without any mental anguish.

00:07:12.235 --> 00:07:15.322
It was his way
of taking responsibility for his sin.

00:07:15.906 --> 00:07:17.032
But he failed.

00:07:18.158 --> 00:07:21.036
Yes. We know all about it now.

00:07:21.828 --> 00:07:25.666
But even so,
he has to see this through to the end.

00:07:27.376 --> 00:07:30.128
I'm certain Daisuke would feel the same.

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:43.392
Human form...

00:07:45.894 --> 00:07:47.229
We've finally met.

00:07:47.938 --> 00:07:48.814
You're...

00:07:58.699 --> 00:07:59.950
Dr. Yura!

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:06.665
<i>When I woke up, I was alone.</i>

00:08:08.542 --> 00:08:11.962
<i>Wasn't I in an accident with Dad?</i>

00:08:13.672 --> 00:08:15.924
<i>Am I wrong? I'm...</i>

00:08:17.134 --> 00:08:21.054
<i>Without knowing it, I had lost my body.</i>

00:08:21.638 --> 00:08:24.391
<i>Why? When? How?</i>

00:08:24.933 --> 00:08:28.437
<i>Am I dead? Is this heaven?</i>

00:08:29.604 --> 00:08:32.399
<i>I started going back</i>
<i>through all my memories.</i>

00:08:38.071 --> 00:08:39.489
<i>This is...</i>

00:08:39.573 --> 00:08:44.161
<i>Then, I found myself overcome</i>
<i>with memories I shouldn't have.</i>

00:08:52.794 --> 00:08:55.297
<i>Who is this? Where am I?</i>

00:08:57.966 --> 00:08:59.718
<i>Where are Mom and Ryota?</i>

00:09:10.103 --> 00:09:12.147
<i>Even I understood that...</i>

00:09:12.689 --> 00:09:14.941
<i>something terrible was happening.</i>

00:09:29.664 --> 00:09:32.876
<i>Then, I found myself floating all alone.</i>

00:09:34.252 --> 00:09:36.421
<i>I couldn't go anywhere.</i>

00:09:37.047 --> 00:09:40.300
<i>Even so,</i>
<i>I was able to protect Mom and Ryota.</i>

00:09:41.218 --> 00:09:42.135
<i>It's all right.</i>

00:09:47.015 --> 00:09:47.849
But...

00:09:48.225 --> 00:09:51.645
gradually I've been losing myself.

00:09:53.688 --> 00:09:55.690
If it keeps up, I might disappear.

00:09:56.399 --> 00:10:00.153
It feels like my consciousness
is slowly slipping away.

00:10:02.531 --> 00:10:05.033
But, I don't feel sad or afraid.

00:10:12.874 --> 00:10:14.042
Isn't this...

00:10:23.677 --> 00:10:24.970
I was so lonely!

00:10:27.055 --> 00:10:29.683
I've wanted to see you, Dr. Yura!

00:10:30.976 --> 00:10:31.852
Yuzuha!

00:10:32.435 --> 00:10:33.770
I waited so long.

00:10:34.563 --> 00:10:35.522
You waited?

00:10:35.605 --> 00:10:39.860
Yes. I'm begging you. Please help me!

00:10:40.193 --> 00:10:41.153
What?

00:10:43.697 --> 00:10:47.534
<i>Is this a dream? Or is it Dream Contact?</i>

00:10:48.451 --> 00:10:51.454
Dr. Yura, I can't move my body.

00:10:52.414 --> 00:10:56.501
I can't speak! I can't even talk to Dad!

00:10:56.585 --> 00:10:58.920
What should I do?

00:10:59.504 --> 00:11:02.048
<i>She must have regained consciousness.</i>

00:11:02.632 --> 00:11:05.385
<i>The human form Matter</i>
<i>is controlled by Yuzuha.</i>

00:11:05.969 --> 00:11:07.554
I don't want to be alone!

00:11:07.971 --> 00:11:09.514
I want to get out of here!

00:11:10.265 --> 00:11:14.352
Where is your body now?
What is its condition?

00:11:15.395 --> 00:11:18.940
I don't know. Where should I go?

00:11:24.404 --> 00:11:25.238
Please!

00:11:26.448 --> 00:11:28.491
You've been alone this whole time?

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:32.871
But, I found something that helped.

00:11:33.622 --> 00:11:35.832
<i>Every day I saw your memories.</i>

00:11:36.958 --> 00:11:41.379
<i>They were like a light</i>
<i>shining into my heart.</i>

00:11:42.464 --> 00:11:44.549
<i>Your happy memories,</i>

00:11:45.342 --> 00:11:46.426
<i>your sad memories,</i>

00:11:47.594 --> 00:11:50.847
<i>and everything else flowed into me,</i>
<i>and kept me alive.</i>

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:54.142
<i>Through you, I was able to laugh.</i>

00:11:55.268 --> 00:11:57.771
<i>I was able to feel anger and cry.</i>

00:11:59.898 --> 00:12:02.776
You're the only reason...

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:04.402
I'm here now.

00:12:04.486 --> 00:12:05.779
Me?

00:12:06.613 --> 00:12:09.074
Thank you for all you've done.

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:17.916
Please!
I want you to rescue Mom and Ryota!

00:12:19.709 --> 00:12:22.879
I heard what Dr. Isazu said, too.

00:12:23.505 --> 00:12:27.425
Before the attack starts,
get them and get out of here.

00:12:27.842 --> 00:12:29.761
What? Escape?

00:12:31.012 --> 00:12:32.305
If we do, you'll...

00:12:32.389 --> 00:12:33.556
There isn't time!

00:12:34.557 --> 00:12:36.643
My time is up.

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:41.231
Your time? Do you mean your consciousness?

00:12:41.773 --> 00:12:42.649
Please!

00:12:45.819 --> 00:12:50.281
<i>The government recognizes this</i>
<i>as an armed attack by a foreign nation.</i>

00:12:50.949 --> 00:12:54.995
<i>This is an official announcement that</i>
<i>the Malignant Area will be incinerated</i>

00:12:55.370 --> 00:13:01.793
<i>by the land, air, and sea branches</i>
<i>of the Self-Defense Forces.</i>

00:13:01.876 --> 00:13:02.919
Come in.

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:06.381
Sir, the government has announced

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:09.676
the attack will
center on Research Facility Two.

00:13:09.759 --> 00:13:11.177
Good timing, Takehara.

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:16.182
I must hurry to Primary Point
to get Aiko Tachibana,

00:13:17.851 --> 00:13:21.604
and suppress the artificial cells
that have turned into Matter.

00:13:22.063 --> 00:13:23.231
Take over in my absence.

00:13:23.565 --> 00:13:25.859
What are you talking about, sir?

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:32.407
I'm sorry, Yuzuha.

00:13:35.785 --> 00:13:36.995
<i>Help me!</i>

00:13:37.579 --> 00:13:38.413
Wait!

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:43.376
Tell me anything you know about your body.
Anything at all.

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:45.628
I don't know a single thing!

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:49.215
Where is my body?

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:53.178
Please, Dr. Yura! Help me!

00:13:54.929 --> 00:13:55.764
Dr. Yura is...

00:13:55.847 --> 00:13:58.058
What? Is something wrong?

00:14:01.811 --> 00:14:03.813
I'll try to suppress the Matter.

00:14:04.689 --> 00:14:06.399
But I might not be much use.

00:14:08.443 --> 00:14:11.321
I'm the only one who can do this.

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:17.327
I'm so glad I met you.

00:14:19.746 --> 00:14:24.626
We didn't have much time,
but I'm glad I got to talk with you.

00:14:24.709 --> 00:14:27.629
What? Wait! Don't go!

00:14:28.421 --> 00:14:30.632
I still have so much to ask you!

00:14:35.345 --> 00:14:36.596
<i>What is this about?</i>

00:14:36.971 --> 00:14:39.307
Like I said, I'm requesting that

00:14:39.391 --> 00:14:42.102
the Self-Defense Forces' attack
stop immediately.

00:14:42.644 --> 00:14:45.355
It can't be stopped
based on your opinion!

00:14:45.939 --> 00:14:49.484
You should be more concerned
about your own position,

00:14:50.193 --> 00:14:52.612
Ms. Nanbara of the Matter Control Agency!

00:14:54.572 --> 00:14:58.451
The responsibility for letting
this situation continue is yours!

00:14:59.369 --> 00:15:03.373
Deal with the remaining Divers
in the Border Zone immediately.

00:15:04.165 --> 00:15:05.667
You want me to?

00:15:06.459 --> 00:15:07.544
Of course!

00:15:12.715 --> 00:15:14.759
What are we going to do, Director?

00:15:17.303 --> 00:15:21.182
I will gladly obey your orders.

00:15:35.447 --> 00:15:36.322
Gummi.

00:15:38.825 --> 00:15:41.035
What should I do?

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:49.544
Wait!

00:16:05.977 --> 00:16:07.312
What are you doing?!

00:16:07.395 --> 00:16:09.731
I'm not letting someone on my team die!

00:16:14.777 --> 00:16:16.321
Why did you follow me?

00:16:18.615 --> 00:16:19.449
Just like...

00:16:20.366 --> 00:16:22.744
Kazuki wants to save Aiko,

00:16:23.661 --> 00:16:26.164
I don't want you to die, either.

00:16:28.625 --> 00:16:32.378
I knew deep down
that Aiko had done nothing wrong.

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:37.675
I couldn't stand to lie to myself anymore.

00:16:39.219 --> 00:16:44.057
So, I want to find a way
to bring us all out of this alive!

00:16:44.974 --> 00:16:45.934
You're crazy.

00:16:48.603 --> 00:16:50.104
Activity has died down.

00:16:51.231 --> 00:16:52.273
Okay, let's go.

00:16:57.987 --> 00:17:00.198
First, we find Kazuki and the others.

00:17:00.615 --> 00:17:01.741
Then we'll talk.

00:17:03.576 --> 00:17:04.494
Okay.

00:17:14.921 --> 00:17:17.340
<i>Dr. Yura?</i>

00:17:18.424 --> 00:17:21.052
<i>Is this the end for me?</i>

00:17:23.429 --> 00:17:27.016
<i>Shinoyama, you believed in me.</i>

00:17:28.017 --> 00:17:30.853
<i>But, it's ending here.</i>

00:17:37.485 --> 00:17:39.904
It's okay for me to trust you, right?

00:17:40.321 --> 00:17:41.155
<i>Tachibana.</i>

00:17:42.407 --> 00:17:43.324
<i>Did I...</i>

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:45.326
<i>Did I...</i>

00:17:46.411 --> 00:17:48.705
<i>make a mistake somewhere?</i>

00:17:49.455 --> 00:17:51.666
<i>What should I do now?</i>

00:18:04.012 --> 00:18:05.179
<i>Dr. Kiryu.</i>

00:18:08.057 --> 00:18:12.645
<i>I still haven't paid you back</i>
<i>for what you did for me.</i>

00:18:13.813 --> 00:18:15.898
<i>I haven't even ended the Burst.</i>

00:18:21.070 --> 00:18:22.238
<i>Tachibana?</i>

00:18:28.244 --> 00:18:29.954
<i>Aiko Tachibana, you're...</i>

00:18:30.371 --> 00:18:32.040
No!

00:18:32.248 --> 00:18:34.208
Please, let go of him!

00:18:34.584 --> 00:18:38.546
-Tachibana!
-No! Don't!

00:18:42.216 --> 00:18:44.135
No!

00:18:46.054 --> 00:18:46.888
Let's hurry!

00:18:48.306 --> 00:18:51.726
Aiko Tachibana!
Why did you choose to do this?

00:19:01.611 --> 00:19:02.445
Gummi?

00:19:11.496 --> 00:19:12.580
I know this place!

00:19:13.915 --> 00:19:15.833
Mom! Ryota!

00:19:28.763 --> 00:19:30.556
Mom! Ryota!

00:19:31.849 --> 00:19:34.811
Wake up, please! Open your eyes!

00:19:35.561 --> 00:19:39.399
Please, Mom! Ryota! Wake up!

00:19:43.361 --> 00:19:44.195
Aiko?

00:19:46.864 --> 00:19:47.699
Aiko?

00:19:51.703 --> 00:19:53.454
It's you, Aiko.

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:55.039
Aiko!

00:20:01.421 --> 00:20:03.339
You've really grown.

00:20:04.507 --> 00:20:07.343
What about your injuries?
Are they all better?

00:20:07.927 --> 00:20:11.013
Yes, they are. I'm fine.

00:20:16.602 --> 00:20:17.562
Aiko!

00:20:25.486 --> 00:20:27.071
Ryota, it's all right.

00:20:28.322 --> 00:20:30.366
I'll save you soon.

00:20:31.117 --> 00:20:34.537
Good. I want to get out of here.

00:20:34.996 --> 00:20:37.498
I want to go to school and see my friends.

00:20:38.082 --> 00:20:41.502
I know. I promise to save you and Mom.

00:20:42.587 --> 00:20:44.088
Are you really all right?

00:20:44.589 --> 00:20:46.799
Who knows
when this will become active again?

00:20:47.467 --> 00:20:49.594
You should escape and save yourself.

00:20:51.345 --> 00:20:52.346
Mom...

00:20:53.681 --> 00:20:56.642
I'm the only one who can do this.

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:01.355
It's all right. It's safe here.

00:21:02.356 --> 00:21:05.735
There are some people who came with me.

00:21:05.818 --> 00:21:06.986
Friends?

00:21:07.987 --> 00:21:09.822
I'm not sure what to call them.

00:21:11.073 --> 00:21:14.327
Aiko, you've worked so hard to get here.

00:21:15.077 --> 00:21:15.912
I...

00:21:16.245 --> 00:21:17.830
You know what, Aiko?

00:21:17.914 --> 00:21:20.041
You seem a lot stronger now.

00:21:20.625 --> 00:21:22.210
What? What do you mean?

00:21:27.006 --> 00:21:31.177
I've laughed and cried a lot.

00:21:32.261 --> 00:21:33.221
Maybe that's it.

00:21:35.139 --> 00:21:37.725
My whole existence here and now

00:21:38.309 --> 00:21:40.061
is thanks to you.

00:21:42.647 --> 00:21:45.900
This is something that only I can do.

00:21:47.109 --> 00:21:49.195
What is wrong, Aiko?

00:21:50.279 --> 00:21:52.532
Don't worry. It's nothing.

00:21:53.616 --> 00:21:55.618
